    "created_at": "2016-10-19T14:48:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T14:48:29Z",
    "body": "Some documents have browsing contexts and some don't; we use that a lot. It seems unrelated.\n\n> You can have a document with a relevant global object, but no Window object.\n\nHow? I think you can have a document without a browsing context, but you can't have a document without a Window object.\n",
