    "created_at": "2016-10-19T14:54:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T14:54:11Z",
    "body": "Ah, yeah, I think you're right. In particular, if we assume _d_'s Window object is the Window whose associated Document is _d_, then probably there is a difference.\n",
